// F6 target after --lock-free: the per-stage mma.commit is commit-only inside
// the K loop, and warpgroup_wait<0>() survives exactly once at the final drain
// before mma.store (section 4.3 / F6 acceptance). Same kernel as
// gap_baseline_per_stage_commit.co, flag on.
//
// RUN: choreo -es -t cute -arch=sm_90a --lock-free tests/gpu/codegen/cute/lock-free/gap_baseline_per_stage_commit.co -o - | grep -v '^ *//' | FileCheck %s --implicit-check-not='named_barrier_sync'

